# X0X_AMY (build/host/x0x_amy_host): USB MIDI and the AMYboard editor's SysEx (engine_amy.c, "MIDI").
# A note on channel 1, a ping, an editor knob message (the filter closed) and the same note again,
# a Python command, a 30-byte file upload (its chunk dropped), then a message that must still play.
# midi_out.txt: OK for the ping, AK for every other SysEx frame.
#   build/host/x0x_amy_host host/amy_midi.x0x OUTDIR
wait 300
wav amy_midi_open.wav
midi 90 3C 64
wait 600
midi 80 3C 00
wait 800
wavstop
sysex zIZ
sysex i1v0F60Z
wait 50
wav amy_midi_closed.wav
midi 90 3C 64
wait 600
midi 80 3C 00
wait 800
wavstop
sysex zPpassZ
sysex zT/user/current/sketch.py,30Z
sysex aW1wb3J0IGFteQpwcmludCgiZm0xLWFteSEhISIp
sysex i1v0F4000Z
wait 50
wav amy_midi_reopened.wav
midi 90 3C 64
wait 600
midi 80 3C 00
wait 800
wavstop
